I walk directly to the water.
I find a quiet place there.
I sit down on a bench.
The wind is quite cold.
I only have my jacket.
But I really like sitting here.
I look at the river.
A large boat slowly goes past.
It is a boat for tourists.
On the other side I see many people.
They are walking right by the water.
Some walk to the left.
Others continue walking straight ahead.
Everyone has a lot of time.
I also have no plans today.
I do not have to go to work.
I just sit here.
I watch the city.
